1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,740
Wombats poop cubes.

2
00:00:02,379 --> 00:00:05,299
Real cubes, with flat sides and sharp corners.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:09,019
A wombat's gut has stiff spots and stretchy spots,

4
00:00:09,279 --> 00:00:11,640
That squeeze the poop into corners as it dries.

5
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:14,679
One wombat makes up to 100 cubes a night,

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,379
And leaves them on rocks to mark its turf.

7
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,359
Round poop would just roll off.

8
00:00:20,019 --> 00:00:21,442
Scientists think that's why
